<title>FRANCE: Lafarge to buy Errce unit.</title>
<headline>Lafarge to buy Errce unit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>French building materials company Lafarge said on Tuesday its Lafarge Monolothiques unit has signed an agreement to buy Hoganas Eldfast from Sweden's Errce.</p>
<p>Hoganas has turnover of 550 million francs, said Lafarge. It gave no details of the purchase price.  </p>
<p>Hoganas makes heat resistant materials.</p>
<p>The acquisition will give Lafarge Monolithiques annual sales of almost 1.2 billion francs.</p>
<p>Lafarge Monolithique is part of Lafarge special products division, which contributes six billion francs to the group's total 35 billion francs turnover.</p>
<p>Lafarge Monolithique sells products into the steel industry, ferrous and non-ferrous foundaries and thermal industries.</p>
